OL,3,AEarly Lampard findings could come
OL,4,Awithin weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of a public inquiry into
OL,7,Fmental health deaths said she would
OL,8,Fmake interim recommendations if she
OL,9,Fidentified issues that "might pose an
OL,10,Furgent risk to patient safety".
OL,12,FBaroness Kate Lampard is examining the
OL,13,Fdeaths of more than 2,000 people who
OL,14,Fdied while under the care of Essex
OL,15,Fmental health services between 2000 and
OL,16,Fthe end of 2023.
OL,18,FThe Lampard Inquiry will hear further
OL,19,Fevidence during hearings beginning on 5
OL,20,FOctober before deciding whether
OL,21,Frecommendations were needed ahead of a
OL,22,Ffinal report, Baroness Lampard said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
